{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Getuigen Verhalen, KNMG - Arts in de bezettingsjaren, interview 07"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:45061"}},{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"nvt."}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"KNMG (Koninklijke Nederlandsche Maatschappij tot bevordering der Geneeskunst), Medisch Contact"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"E.  Nyst"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"KNMG"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>De geinterviewde is als student geneeskunde uit Groningen naar Duitsland afgevoerd om daar te werken. Hij werkte in twee ziekenhuizen en verzorgde Duitse zieken en gewonden. Hij werd hier zeer goed behandeld.<br>Tijdens verlof wist hij te ontsnappen naar Nederland waar hij onderdook. Met een vals paspoort werkte hij als hulparts bij een arts in Grootegast tot het einde van de oorlog.<br>00:03:00 Opgepakt en naar Duitsland vervoerd.<br>00:10:00 Difterie in Duitsland.<br>00:20:00 Bombardement Duitsland waarna verlof als dank.<br>00:42:00 Werken bij arts in Grootegast<br>01:04:00 Studenten corps<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Date Submitted: 2010-02-25"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Medicine, Health and Life Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Universiteit"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"theaterarts"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Duitsland"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"bombardement"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"onderduiken"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"loyaliteitsverklaring"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"amputaties"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Oral history"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2009-07-29"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Lutke Schipholt, Ingrid L.E. (journalist Medisch Contact)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Eva Nyst (medisch Contact)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Paul Gadella audiovisuele producties (opnameleiding)"}},{"contributorName":{"ty